{"751630": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "After the Fall®", "steam_appid": 751630, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [1819510, 1310900, 1819150, 1819470, 1820230], "detailed_description": "<h1>Digital Deluxe Edition</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/751630/extras/8791a08b4133edc0b8551f0cef1aa57e.avif?t=1771848220\" width=600 height=338 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The After the Fall® - Deluxe Edition contains:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Exclusive &quot;Uncle Bob” Weapon Skin</strong></li></ul>Pay homage to the original killing machine with this Steam exclusive “Uncle Bob” Weapon Skin.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>After the Fall® Digital Artbook</strong></li></ul>A hand-picked selection of the best concept art and artwork of After the Fall's frozen dystopia, brought together in a Digital Artbook<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>After the Fall® Official Soundtrack</strong></li></ul></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/751630/extras/36864a1508f0a8bbc871765e2334c47c.avif?t=1771848220\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/751630/extras_big/36864a1508f0a8bbc871765e2334c47c.webp?t=1771848220 width=1560 height=571 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built from the ground up for VR, After the Fall is the ultimate multiplayer zombie apocalypse! Team up with up to 3 fellow survivors and take on a twisted, hostile world where all hell has frozen over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in the ice-covered ruins of 1980s LA nearly 20 years after the apocalypse, After the Fall® combines an evolving VR world shared with players on all platforms with action-packed co-op gameplay, built from the ground up for VR.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture out into the remains of post-apocalyptic LA, wield deadly weapons and devastating powers with real-life movements as you develop your combat style, and join forces with players worldwide. Go head to head with hordes and towering bosses in a bid to leave the city a better place than your predecessors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intense Co-op VR Action:</strong> Go solo or team up with friends in 4-player co-op through an evolving, 1980s-inspired VR world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hell Has Frozen Over:</strong> Venture out into the ice-covered and snowbreed-infested ruins of dystopian LA to take the city’s future in your hands[</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Not Your Average Undead:</strong> Fight huge hordes, Specials and colossal bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover Your Combat Style:</strong> Craft, upgrade and wield a large variety of deadly weapons and devastating powers, all with real-life movements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Go head to head in fast-paced 4v4 combat</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/751630/extras/a1d2aa107c996af2288976f91fc7acc6.avif?t=1771848220\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/751630/extras_big/a1d2aa107c996af2288976f91fc7acc6.webp?t=1771848220 width=1560 height=475 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/751630/extras/36864a1508f0a8bbc871765e2334c47c.avif?t=1771848220\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/751630/extras_big/36864a1508f0a8bbc871765e2334c47c.webp?t=1771848220 width=1560 height=571 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built from the ground up for VR, After the Fall is the ultimate multiplayer zombie apocalypse! Team up with up to 3 fellow survivors and take on a twisted, hostile world where all hell has frozen over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in the ice-covered ruins of 1980s LA nearly 20 years after the apocalypse, After the Fall® combines an evolving VR world shared with players on all platforms with action-packed co-op gameplay, built from the ground up for VR.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture out into the remains of post-apocalyptic LA, wield deadly weapons and devastating powers with real-life movements as you develop your combat style, and join forces with players worldwide. Go head to head with hordes and towering bosses in a bid to leave the city a better place than your predecessors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intense Co-op VR Action:</strong> Go solo or team up with friends in 4-player co-op through an evolving, 1980s-inspired VR world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hell Has Frozen Over:</strong> Venture out into the ice-covered and snowbreed-infested ruins of dystopian LA to take the city’s future in your hands[</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Not Your Average Undead:</strong> Fight huge hordes, Specials and colossal bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover Your Combat Style:</strong> Craft, upgrade and wield a large variety of deadly weapons and devastating powers, all with real-life movements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Go head to head in fast-paced 4v4 combat</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/751630/extras/a1d2aa107c996af2288976f91fc7acc6.avif?t=17718482